    IF form EQUALS `o 27 r 8 the form of the direction to the Accountant-General`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (silent): the Rule says money "must be paid out on a direction to the Accountant‑General in Form 44(b)" and does not say what follows if it is paid out another way

