-- src:4166 | (3) Subject to paragraph (4), the Court may direct that any money in Court, other than money under Order 9, Rule 17, Order 14 or Order 33, or as security for costs, may be invested in any of the securities in which trustees are by law permitted to invest trust money in their hands.
