        IF `the person making the payment produced a copy of the judgment or order` AND `the person making the payment gave notice to the person entitled to the money` THEN JUST TRUE
        OTHERWISE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (silent): the Rule says the person "must" produce a copy and give notice and does not say what follows if the person does not

