        IF `the Sheriff required proof to his or her satisfaction that the person applying for payment is the person entitled or authorised to receive it` THEN JUST TRUE
        OTHERWISE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (silent): the Rule says the Sheriff "must require proof" and does not say what follows if he or she does not

